{
  // Type-checks the package INCLUDING its out-of-src tests.
  //
  // Extends the BASE config rather than ./tsconfig.json on purpose: that one carries `rootDir: "src"` +
  // `outDir` for the dist build, and a rootDir cannot contain files outside itself. Inheriting it yields
  // hundreds of TS6059s — first for test/, then for the cross-package `../../core/src` imports the itests use
  // deliberately (bun's per-package node_modules means a relative barrel import is the working shape there).
  // Emit settings are irrelevant here; this config only ever runs with noEmit.
  //
  // Why it exists: the itests were never type-checked at all. `bun test` compiles them at run time, so a
  // wrong signature — applyMigrations takes a connection string, not an options object — passed typecheck,
  // passed lint, and failed in CI behind a misleading "password authentication failed for user runner".
  //
  // The exclude list is a RATCHET, in the same spirit as migrationSnapshots.test.ts's EXPECTED_DEFICIT.
  // These 17 files carry 56 pre-existing errors; they are excluded rather than silenced so that every OTHER
  // itest — and every NEW one — is checked from now on, which is the case that actually bit. Most are the
  // same shape: `const [r] = await sql...` then `r.foo`, where the row is only implicitly known to exist.
  // Fixing that means making the implication explicit, and doing it 56 times quickly is how an assertion
  // gets weakened instead of corrected — so the list shrinks deliberately, file by file. It must never grow.
  //
  // A few are worth more than a mechanical fix and should not be swept in with the rest:
  //   - masterBackfill / pipelineStages / search / customFields: unused bindings (TS6133/TS6196), i.e. dead
  //     setup that may mark an assertion someone meant to write.
  //   - masterGraphResolve / search: `string | null` passed where a string is required, which is a real
  //     nullability question about the data rather than a cast.
  "extends": "../../tsconfig.base.json",
  "compilerOptions": { "noEmit": true },
  "include": ["src", "test"],
  "exclude": ["test/masterBackfill.itest.ts"]
}
